---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/blog/"
title: "Drain & Sewer Tips | Honest Drain"
description: "Practical drain and sewer advice from Honest Drain, including clog warning signs, maintenance guidance, and help deciding when to call a professional."
canonical: "__SITE_URL__/blog/"
robots: "index,follow"
ogTitle: "Drain & Sewer Tips | Honest Drain"
ogDescription: "Practical drain and sewer advice from Honest Drain for homeowners, businesses, and property managers."
ogType: "website"
ogUrl: "__SITE_URL__/blog/"
sitemap:
  order: 4
  lastmod: "2026-08-15"
  changefreq: "weekly"
  priority: "0.75"
schema:
  - |-
    {"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "__SITE_URL__/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Blog", "item": "__SITE_URL__/blog/"}]}
  - |-
    {"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "Blog", "name": "Honest Drain Blog", "description": "Practical drain and sewer advice from Honest Drain for homeowners, businesses, and property managers.", "url": "__SITE_URL__/blog/", "publisher": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Honest Drain", "url": "__SITE_URL__/"}}
---
<main id="main">
  <section class="page-hero page-hero--plain blog-index-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Honest Drain blog</p>
      <h1>Useful answers for drains, sewers, and the problems between them</h1>
      <p>Clear guidance for homeowners, businesses, and property managers—written to help you spot trouble early and make a confident next move.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cards">
    <div class="container">
      {% if collections.blogPosts.length %}
      <div class="blog-grid">
        {% for post in collections.blogPosts %}
        <article class="post-card">
          {% if post.data.image %}<a class="post-card__image" href="{{ post.url | url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ post.data.image | url }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="560" height="340"></a>{% endif %}
          <div class="post-card__body">
            <p class="eyebrow">{{ post.data.category }}</p>
            <h2><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
            <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
            <div class="post-card__footer">
              <time datetime="{{ post.data.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.data.date | postDate }}</time>
              <a href="{{ post.url | url }}" aria-label="Read {{ post.data.title }}">Read article</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% else %}
      <div class="blog-empty">
        <h2>Helpful articles are on the way.</h2>
        <p>In the meantime, call or book online for an honest answer about your drain or sewer problem.</p>
        <a class="button" href="{{ '/contact.html' | url }}">Book Online</a>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--compact section--muted">
    <div class="container mini-cta">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Have an active backup?</p>
        <h2>Advice is useful. Fast help is better when water is rising.</h2>
        <p>Call for urgent drain or sewer problems, or book a standard visit online.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mini-cta__actions"><a class="button" href="{{ '/contact.html' | url }}">Book Online</a><a class="mini-cta__phone" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">Call {{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
